### Varsayılan — sayfa 1, 10 kayıt
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Sayfa 2
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?page=2&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### İsme göre ara
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?search=laptop
Accept: application/json

### Kategoriye göre filtrele
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?category=electronics
Accept: application/json

### Fiyat aralığına göre filtrele
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?minPrice=100&maxPrice=500
Accept: application/json

### Fiyata göre azalan sırala
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc
Accept: application/json

### Hepsini birleştir
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?page=1&pageSize=5&category=electronics&minPrice=50&maxPrice=1000&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json

### Büyük sayfa — max 100 ile sınırlandı
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products?pageSize=200
Accept: application/json